00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:57.700
and each half into half

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:59.420
verse worth of cloud

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:00.820
and a gazillion of them

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:02.460
we understand how each one of them works

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:03.420
and put it together

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:06.200
and put it together

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:08.510
it doesn't work that way

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.930
華曰論在神經科學有過一次很漂亮的成功

