00:32:45.530 --> 00:32:46.710
You don't do this

00:32:46.710 --> 00:32:48.090
So I'm sitting there

00:32:48.090 --> 00:32:48.850
And I'm saying

00:32:48.850 --> 00:32:50.050
Well, you know

00:32:50.050 --> 00:32:52.490
This is kind of hard for me

00:32:52.490 --> 00:32:53.810
To tell the difference here

00:32:53.810 --> 00:32:59.610
And she says in a sense

00:32:59.610 --> 00:33:03.100
And that's the core ultimately

00:33:03.100 --> 00:33:05.960
那是否有必要的目的

00:33:05.960 --> 00:33:07.820
那思覺失調症

00:33:07.820 --> 00:33:09.740
到底是天生的還是環境造成的

00:33:09.740 --> 00:33:12.500
